    "detailed_description": "This is a puzzle game.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nYou have a brown box, and it's best to put all the colored balls that fall from the sky inside.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nThe brown box is easy to operate, and its movement is controlled by the up, down, left, and right keys to determine the position of the balls and catch them in a timely manner.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nWill it fall from an unstable place, on the left or right? Do you have the confidence to score high in this game?<br />\r\n<br />\r\nGame controls<br />\r\n<br />\r\nMobile box=\u2191\u2193\u2190\u2192<br />\r\n<br />\r\nGameplay<br />\r\n<br />\r\nYou need to move the box to catch the colored ball<br />\r\n<br />\r\nIf you successfully receive the ball, it will display success+1<br />\r\n<br />\r\nIf you haven't received the ball, it will display as failed+1<br />\r\n<br />\r\nGame features<br />\r\n<br />\r\nIntense and exciting games, exercise your reaction ability<br />\r\n<br />\r\nAnticipate the final position in advance and test your judgment",
    "about_the_game": "This is a puzzle game.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nYou have a brown box, and it's best to put all the colored balls that fall from the sky inside.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nThe brown box is easy to operate, and its movement is controlled by the up, down, left, and right keys to determine the position of the balls and catch them in a timely manner.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nWill it fall from an unstable place, on the left or right? Do you have the confidence to score high in this game?<br />\r\n<br />\r\nGame controls<br />\r\n<br />\r\nMobile box=\u2191\u2193\u2190\u2192<br />\r\n<br />\r\nGameplay<br />\r\n<br />\r\nYou need to move the box to catch the colored ball<br />\r\n<br />\r\nIf you successfully receive the ball, it will display success+1<br />\r\n<br />\r\nIf you haven't received the ball, it will display as failed+1<br />\r\n<br />\r\nGame features<br />\r\n<br />\r\nIntense and exciting games, exercise your reaction ability<br />\r\n<br />\r\nAnticipate the final position in advance and test your judgment",
